Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Kuusaa-nageenyaa haaraa: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault iccitiisi: message furtuu: key.
>> decrypted := vault icciitii-hiiki: encrypted furtuu: key.

Baʼii 
barreessi: ['Message:'], dhaabi
barreessi: message, dhaabi
barreessi: ['Decrypted:'], dhaabi
barreessi: decrypted, dhaabi.
